      "The reasoning follows. It is the longest part. It walks through earlier cases, statutes and consequences. It must show why those cases point where the court says.",
      "A dissent is printed after. Its author lost. A dissent binds nobody. Its job is to mark where the disagreement lies, not to restate the whole dispute.",
